# ── Runtime user state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything in STATE_DIR is gitignored: runs, datasets, audio, checkpoint
# symlinks, gradio logs, state JSONs. Defaults to <repo>/state/ — overridable
# via UNDERFIT_STATE_DIR. If a user points STATE_DIR elsewhere, that location
# isn't covered by .gitignore, but it's also outside the repo so git won't see
# it anyway.
state/

# ── Editor / OS / build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.tmp
*.bak.*

dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
node_modules/

# Assistant-backend runtime state (sessions, logs, generated artifacts)
assistant-backend/data/

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── Python venv (multi-GB, machine-specific; uv also self-ignores it) ────
.venv/

# ── Gradio runtime cache ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.gradio/

# ── Local scratch: underscore-prefixed one-off debug scripts, JSON dumps,
#    and server logs, plus dated .bak snapshots. Kept on disk, never
#    uploaded. (_[!_]* avoids matching __init__.py and other dunder files.)
_[!_]*.py
_[!_]*.json
*.bak-*

# ── Agent / tooling artifacts (Claude Code, Serena, Playwright, repomix) ─
.claude/
.serena/
.playwright-mcp/
repomix-output.md

# ── Internal process notes: plans, reports, audits, session changelogs.
#    (Served docs in docs/thedaw-style/ stay TRACKED — they're app content.)
docs/plans/
docs/reports/
docs/changes/
docs/audits/
docs/internal/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Logs & model weights never belong in the repo ───────────────────────
*.log
*.safetensors
*.ckpt

# ── Internal-only docs & scripts (not part of the public release) ───────
_internal/
CLAUDE.md
LEARNINGS.md
